    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n53754" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">καταγγελ-ία</span></b> , ἡ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>proclamation</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πολέμου</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Luc.
					<u>Par.</u>
					42
				</span></i>
			; esp. of games or festivals, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐκ καταγγελίας ἐπιτελεῖν ἀγῶνα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plu.
					<u>Rom.</u>
					14
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὴν κ. ἐποιήσαντο πρεπόντως</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>OGI</u>
					319.13
				</span></i>
			 (<i><span class="en">
				Magn.
			</span></i> Mae., <span class="entity">ii B.C.</span>), cf. <i><span class="en">
				<u>CIG</u>
				3656.6
			</span></i> (Cyzicus, <span class="entity">ii B.C.</span>); <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὰν
				κ. ἀποδέχεται</span> ib.<i><span class="en">
				12
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>denunciation</i>, <i><span class="en">
